: "mereka menyadari", "ur": "وہ شعور رکھتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা টের পায়", "fa": "درک می‌کنند"}}]}, {"ref": "26:113", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3045.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Lo! their reckoning is my Lord's concern, if ye but knew;", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Onların hesabı ancak Rabbime aittir. Düşünsenize!\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ان کا حساب تو میرے رب ہی پر ہے اگر تمہیں حِس ہو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Perhitungan (amal perbuatan) mereka tidak lain hanyalah kepada Tuhanku, kalau kamu menyadari.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حِسَابُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِلَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبِّى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَشْعُرُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/1feb3bc0d5846535475f.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) perceive", "bs": "osjećate", "tr": "algılıyorsunuz", "fr": "vous percevez", "id": "kalian merasakan", "ur": "تم محسوس کرتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা অনুভব কর", "fa": "احساس می‌کنید"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَشْعُرُونَ", "count": 21, "first": "2:9", "audio": "audio/a2928a752fb4b7cc6e68.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "osjećaju", "en": "they perceive", "tr": "hissederler", "fr": "ils (ne) perçoivent (pas)", "id": "mereka menyadari", "ur": "وہ شعور رکھتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা টের পায়", "fa": "درک می‌کنند"}}, {"arabic": "تَشْعُرُونَ", "count": 4, "first": "2:154", "audio":